(2159094, 295736, 45764, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you did this, but I think the focus might have hurt this image.  Still very nice.</td>', 'I don''t know how you did this, but I think the focus might have hurt this image.  Still very nice.', '2006-02-17 12:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159096, 295784, 45764, '<td valign="top">Nicely arranged, I had a similar idea I was going to use for the Romance challenge.  I just never went through with it.  I really like it.</td>', 'Nicely arranged, I had a similar idea I was going to use for the Romance challenge.  I just never went through with it.  I really like it.', '2006-02-17 12:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159099, 295727, 45764, '<td valign="top">Very creative, a lot of attention to detail making the little seeds heart shaped as well.</td>', 'Very creative, a lot of attention to detail making the little seeds heart shaped as well.', '2006-02-17 12:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159168, 295632, 39988, '<td valign="top">Nice touch with the clouds and child in foreground.  Simple yet speaks volumes.  I rated this a 6</td>', 'Nice touch with the clouds and child in foreground.  Simple yet speaks volumes.  I rated this a 6', '2006-02-17 13:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159190, 295908, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clarity and soft light. What a honeybun.</td>', 'Beautiful clarity and soft light. What a honeybun.', '2006-02-17 13:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159195, 295617, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very well lit. Background color works well with the color of the flowers. Gives photo a nice, warm feel. Black specks are a bit of a distraction but because the photo has an "old" feeling, they don''t really bother me too much.</td>', 'Very well lit. Background color works well with the color of the flowers. Gives photo a nice, warm feel. Black specks are a bit of a distraction but because the photo has an "old" feeling, they don''t really bother me too much.', '2006-02-17 13:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159213, 295733, 3087, '<td valign="top">A clever idea indeed but the heart-shaped smoke doesn''t work well for me - because it''s quite a dense area of smoke it''s more obvious that the edges have been erased away in post-processing. I have no problem with using post-processing by the way, but in this case it doesn''t quite create a believable result. My feeling is that if there were just a few strong swirls of smoke, a touch more spread out, and then the edges erased into a heart shape, it might look more natural. Anyway, I still like this shot a lot - the pose and lighting are good and the idea is a fun one!</td>', 'A clever idea indeed but the heart-shaped smoke doesn''t work well for me - because it''s quite a dense area of smoke it''s more obvious that the edges have been erased away in post-processing. I have no problem with using post-processing by the way, but in this case it doesn''t quite create a believable result. My feeling is that if there were just a few strong swirls of smoke, a touch more spread out, and then the edges erased into a heart shape, it might look more natural. Anyway, I still like this shot a lot - the pose and lighting are good and the idea is a fun one!', '2006-02-17 13:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159217, 295590, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely idea and well executed too. I really like your purple toning and the strong vignette too. The strong light and shadows work well - I particularly like how deep the shadow inside the folded pages are - it makes the heart shape really stand out. It''s a shame that the page forming the left side of the heart doesn''t seem to have the same densely packed text on it as the other tree pages shown - perhaps it''s a chapter heading or something? But it''s not a big deal. I am curious about what the book is...</td>', 'This is a lovely idea and well executed too. I really like your purple toning and the strong vignette too. The strong light and shadows work well - I particularly like how deep the shadow inside the folded pages are - it makes the heart shape really stand out. It''s a shame that the page forming the left side of the heart doesn''t seem to have the same densely packed text on it as the other tree pages shown - perhaps it''s a chapter heading or something? But it''s not a big deal. I am curious about what the book is...', '2006-02-17 13:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159218, 295615, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cool! Love the colours and textures and the rotated main subject.</td>', 'Cool! Love the colours and textures and the rotated main subject.', '2006-02-17 13:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159220, 295622, 22781, '<td valign="top">Is this real or is this Photoshopped?<br/>Never mind, it´s my top rated pic. 10!</td>', 'Is this real or is this Photoshopped?Never mind, it´s my top rated pic. 10!', '2006-02-17 13:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159221, 295882, 3087, '<td valign="top">Clever idea! Postprocessing is a little clumsy - I can see hard lines at the edges where you''ve selectively removed/ whitened the background - around the heart and it''s shadow. However, that''s something you can definitely redo and tidy up and the idea itself works well.</td>', 'Clever idea! Postprocessing is a little clumsy - I can see hard lines at the edges where you''ve selectively removed/ whitened the background - around the heart and it''s shadow. However, that''s something you can definitely redo and tidy up and the idea itself works well.', '2006-02-17 13:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159266, 295703, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not entirely sure what I''m looking at but it doesn''t matter - it''s an abstract object somewhat like a glass lamp with a glittery red heart inside. I like the composition and repeating circles a lot and the colour palette too. Nice one!</td>', 'Not entirely sure what I''m looking at but it doesn''t matter - it''s an abstract object somewhat like a glass lamp with a glittery red heart inside. I like the composition and repeating circles a lot and the colour palette too. Nice one!', '2006-02-17 14:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159269, 295885, 3087, '<td valign="top">Is this a heart of drugs instead of a line? I''m a bit confused as I don''t quite get the concept. On the photo front I like the texture and the black and white presentation.</td>', 'Is this a heart of drugs instead of a line? I''m a bit confused as I don''t quite get the concept. On the photo front I like the texture and the black and white presentation.', '2006-02-17 14:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159271, 295632, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sweet! I like hte way the child is standing on the edge of the frame - the land is unimportant to the shot and thus excluded - very brave. I like the heart shaped cloud - I might have played around with it a touch to exaggerate the heart shape further but it''s certainly discernable. Fun and different!</td>', 'Sweet! I like hte way the child is standing on the edge of the frame - the land is unimportant to the shot and thus excluded - very brave. I like the heart shaped cloud - I might have played around with it a touch to exaggerate the heart shape further but it''s certainly discernable. Fun and different!', '2006-02-17 14:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159274, 295761, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sweet! Isn''t he young to be mulling over love already or am I just old and forgetting how young one can succumb? :0) I like the plain backdrop and the lighting too though it seems a touch strong. The flowers and their vibrant colours are wonderful. I find the flash of denim distracting and wonder if this would have been stronger had he been shot in plainer underpants or shorts? Off-centred composition with the legs giving depth, works very well.</td>', 'Sweet! Isn''t he young to be mulling over love already or am I just old and forgetting how young one can succumb? :0) I like the plain backdrop and the lighting too though it seems a touch strong. The flowers and their vibrant colours are wonderful. I find the flash of denim distracting and wonder if this would have been stronger had he been shot in plainer underpants or shorts? Off-centred composition with the legs giving depth, works very well.', '2006-02-17 14:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159279, 295533, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait! The grittiness, exaggerated colour and contrast work well. The eye contact is fantastic. So too is the tight crop (by crop I mean either when taken or afterwards). I''m not sure what the heart is - card? chocolates? - but it doesn''t matter hugely.</td>', 'Nice portrait! The grittiness, exaggerated colour and contrast work well. The eye contact is fantastic. So too is the tight crop (by crop I mean either when taken or afterwards). I''m not sure what the heart is - card? chocolates? - but it doesn''t matter hugely.', '2006-02-17 14:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159289, 295760, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for shallow DOF and I like how you''ve used it here. My main criticism is simply in placement of the items - I''d like to see as much of a horizontal gap between foreground and centre heart as between centre and backmost heart. I think a more diagonal line from left to right would also strengthen composition.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for shallow DOF and I like how you''ve used it here. My main criticism is simply in placement of the items - I''d like to see as much of a horizontal gap between foreground and centre heart as between centre and backmost heart. I think a more diagonal line from left to right would also strengthen composition.', '2006-02-17 14:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159292, 295918, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! So many sweeties (candies, in American speak)! I''m jealous, I want some of that! This works really well - your composition and angle is excellent. I love the detail in the eyes. The lips appear rather bleached out and might benefit from a touch of lip colour - not so strong that it overwhelms the sweets but enough to give them a touch more life. Regardless, I think this is great!</td>', 'Wow! So many sweeties (candies, in American speak)! I''m jealous, I want some of that! This works really well - your composition and angle is excellent. I love the detail in the eyes. The lips appear rather bleached out and might benefit from a touch of lip colour - not so strong that it overwhelms the sweets but enough to give them a touch more life. Regardless, I think this is great!', '2006-02-17 14:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159297, 295617, 3087, '<td valign="top">Pretty - I like how the background echoes the flowers so well. Nice composition - a bit different but works. Nice detail and interesting collage effect with the text and the texture of the background.</td>', 'Pretty - I like how the background echoes the flowers so well. Nice composition - a bit different but works. Nice detail and interesting collage effect with the text and the texture of the background.', '2006-02-17 14:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159304, 295772, 9765, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I think we have a winner here (-:</td>', 'Very nice. I think we have a winner here (-:', '2006-02-17 14:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159325, 295537, 3087, '<td valign="top">Strange but cool! More art than photo but it''s all good to me! Nicely done!</td>', 'Strange but cool! More art than photo but it''s all good to me! Nicely done!', '2006-02-17 14:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159326, 295564, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is so strange and yet I like it anyway! I''m not sure of the significance of two chillis crossed into a heart shape nor the reason the tip touches the sun or the combination with a sea scape but... I do like surrealism and this one works for me!</td>', 'This is so strange and yet I like it anyway! I''m not sure of the significance of two chillis crossed into a heart shape nor the reason the tip touches the sun or the combination with a sea scape but... I do like surrealism and this one works for me!', '2006-02-17 14:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159332, 295727, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2006-02-17 14:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159390, 295801, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely image - simple but effective. Nice composition, I happen not to like pink but that''s just a personal taste thing and not a negative against this picture.</td>', 'Lovely image - simple but effective. Nice composition, I happen not to like pink but that''s just a personal taste thing and not a negative against this picture.', '2006-02-17 15:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159391, 295622, 3087, '<td valign="top">Kind of spooky but it does work!</td>', 'Kind of spooky but it does work!', '2006-02-17 15:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159392, 295860, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cute! I like the mosaic idea a lot... The broken one is well positioned but why can''t we see any broken up letters? The surface seems to be missing! There seem to be some strange artifacts along many of the edges of the hearts - perhaps from compression or one of the processing steps. Cute image though!</td>', 'Cute! I like the mosaic idea a lot... The broken one is well positioned but why can''t we see any broken up letters? The surface seems to be missing! There seem to be some strange artifacts along many of the edges of the hearts - perhaps from compression or one of the processing steps. Cute image though!', '2006-02-17 15:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159493, 295883, 38508, '<td valign="top">Waauw!! I really like this shot!!<br/>Amazing how you did this!</td>', 'Waauw!! I really like this shot!!Amazing how you did this!', '2006-02-17 16:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159495, 295564, 38508, '<td valign="top">Great shot!<br/>Colors are wonderfull!</td>', 'Great shot!Colors are wonderfull!', '2006-02-17 16:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159496, 295635, 38508, '<td valign="top">Not only very unsharp.... But I kept on guessing where the heart is...</td>', 'Not only very unsharp.... But I kept on guessing where the heart is...', '2006-02-17 16:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159518, 295614, 3087, '<td valign="top">A sweet idea. Because of the angle of view a lot of the impact of the shape is lost as it''s obviously skewed by perspective. Compositionally this isn''t strong for me with the heart floating in the middle of a somewhat nondescript pool though the patterns are somewhat interesting. The reflection at the top left is distracting though the dark green shadow at the bottom is OK.</td>', 'A sweet idea. Because of the angle of view a lot of the impact of the shape is lost as it''s obviously skewed by perspective. Compositionally this isn''t strong for me with the heart floating in the middle of a somewhat nondescript pool though the patterns are somewhat interesting. The reflection at the top left is distracting though the dark green shadow at the bottom is OK.', '2006-02-17 17:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159521, 295628, 6519, '<td valign="top">LOL..... thanks for the giggle! And pat on the back for a nice photo, too.</td>', 'LOL..... thanks for the giggle! And pat on the back for a nice photo, too.', '2006-02-17 17:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159669, 295757, 35720, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, great expression, good lighting and composition. I think I know who took this shot. Good luck! Bumping up!</td>', 'Excellent shot, great expression, good lighting and composition. I think I know who took this shot. Good luck! Bumping up!', '2006-02-17 19:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159697, 295882, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think the heart should have been in focus.  The line on the left side is very distracting.</td>', 'I think the heart should have been in focus.  The line on the left side is very distracting.', '2006-02-17 19:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159885, 295590, 53249, '<td valign="top">I like it, that''s the most I can say...</td>', 'I like it, that''s the most I can say...', '2006-02-17 20:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160162, 295473, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very fun, whimsical shot LOVE the background.</td>', 'Very fun, whimsical shot LOVE the background.', '2006-02-17 22:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160232, 295784, 45022, '<td valign="top">I love this picture! Excellent shot!</td>', 'I love this picture! Excellent shot!', '2006-02-17 23:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160244, 295883, 52524, '<td valign="top">id have to say its omazing<br/>luv</td>', 'id have to say its omazingluv', '2006-02-17 23:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160597, 295733, 18349, '<td valign="top">Man...do you have any idea how adorable this is?  ;)  Awesome idea, excellent shot.  :)</td>', 'Man...do you have any idea how adorable this is?  ;)  Awesome idea, excellent shot.  :)', '2006-02-18 04:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160781, 295622, 31244, '<td valign="top">Wow i like it. 8</td>', 'Wow i like it. 8', '2006-02-18 09:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160785, 295585, 31244, '<td valign="top">Woah cool effect. 9</td>', 'Woah cool effect. 9', '2006-02-18 09:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160787, 295733, 31244, '<td valign="top">Very good idea. 8</td>', 'Very good idea. 8', '2006-02-18 09:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160789, 295784, 31244, '<td valign="top">Good DOF.</td>', 'Good DOF.', '2006-02-18 09:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160793, 295887, 31244, '<td valign="top">GraphicFunk? Anyway great shot 9</td>', 'GraphicFunk? Anyway great shot 9', '2006-02-18 09:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160858, 295733, 25906, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea but it looks like the smoke is coming out of his ear not his mouth...good luck</td>', 'This is a good idea but it looks like the smoke is coming out of his ear not his mouth...good luck', '2006-02-18 09:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160860, 295619, 25906, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, the faces seem a little too dark though. It seems to me that they should be the subject of the photo. Good luck</td>', 'Nice idea, the faces seem a little too dark though. It seems to me that they should be the subject of the photo. Good luck', '2006-02-18 09:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160863, 295721, 25906, '<td valign="top">Very touching, very nice contrast and lighting. I think this one will do well. This would make a really nice greeting card too.</td>', 'Very touching, very nice contrast and lighting. I think this one will do well. This would make a really nice greeting card too.', '2006-02-18 09:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160865, 295915, 25906, '<td valign="top">The whites seem a little blown out, but it is a good idea. Good luck</td>', 'The whites seem a little blown out, but it is a good idea. Good luck', '2006-02-18 09:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160868, 295919, 25906, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t do anything for me, it is very grainy, maybe that was the intention, not sure...good luck</td>', 'This just doesn''t do anything for me, it is very grainy, maybe that was the intention, not sure...good luck', '2006-02-18 09:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160870, 295809, 25906, '<td valign="top">I love this one, I love the contrast and saturation. I think this one will do well. Good luck</td>', 'I love this one, I love the contrast and saturation. I think this one will do well. Good luck', '2006-02-18 10:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160871, 295628, 25906, '<td valign="top">Very funny, the tatoo needs to be lit a little more, some people may not be able to see what it says. good luck.</td>', 'Very funny, the tatoo needs to be lit a little more, some people may not be able to see what it says. good luck.', '2006-02-18 10:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160872, 295823, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow - that''s some background. I find the color of the background fights with the color of the heart lettuce leaf - at least for me.</td>', 'Wow - that''s some background. I find the color of the background fights with the color of the heart lettuce leaf - at least for me.', '2006-02-18 10:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160874, 295762, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of your abstract. The shapes and colors work well with one another. I''m not too crazy about the outer large gray border, but good use of shadows. This would be a fun image to hand in a gynecologist''s waiting room - give people something to look at and ponder in a fun way. :-)</td>', 'I like the simplicity of your abstract. The shapes and colors work well with one another. I''m not too crazy about the outer large gray border, but good use of shadows. This would be a fun image to hand in a gynecologist''s waiting room - give people something to look at and ponder in a fun way. :-)', '2006-02-18 10:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160875, 295887, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Nice photoshop work. The hand color is a bit dark for me personally, but overall a very cool and imaginative image.</td>', 'Very creative. Nice photoshop work. The hand color is a bit dark for me personally, but overall a very cool and imaginative image.', '2006-02-18 10:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160876, 295673, 41675, '<td valign="top">Not a bad photo, but there''s something about the composition that doesn''t quite hold my interest. I do like how you kept the rose petals red and changed the rest of the image to black and white.</td>', 'Not a bad photo, but there''s something about the composition that doesn''t quite hold my interest. I do like how you kept the rose petals red and changed the rest of the image to black and white.', '2006-02-18 10:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160878, 295753, 41675, '<td valign="top">LOL! ha, ha hah! I like your image very much, simple, but well executed in composition and lighting. Good luck in the challenge. 10</td>', 'LOL! ha, ha hah! I like your image very much, simple, but well executed in composition and lighting. Good luck in the challenge. 10', '2006-02-18 10:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160881, 295828, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the lighting is a little too harsh, but I like the composition and idea behind your image. I also like the texture of the background.</td>', 'For me, the lighting is a little too harsh, but I like the composition and idea behind your image. I also like the texture of the background.', '2006-02-18 10:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160883, 295533, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good entry into the challenge. I like the background wall and the boy himself. It''s the treatment of the heart on his chest that I like least about your photo. Otherwise well done. 8</td>', 'Good entry into the challenge. I like the background wall and the boy himself. It''s the treatment of the heart on his chest that I like least about your photo. Otherwise well done. 8', '2006-02-18 10:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160884, 295599, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good photoshop work, funny photo, it makes me smile.</td>', 'Good photoshop work, funny photo, it makes me smile.', '2006-02-18 10:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160887, 295622, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, although her skin seems so smooth it looks almost doll-like. I like the heart rings in her eyes.</td>', 'Nice portrait, although her skin seems so smooth it looks almost doll-like. I like the heart rings in her eyes.', '2006-02-18 10:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160888, 295903, 41675, '<td valign="top">You''ve created a very powerful image. Once that''s easy for the viewer to interpret. I like that about your photo. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You''ve created a very powerful image. Once that''s easy for the viewer to interpret. I like that about your photo. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-02-18 10:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160893, 295709, 41675, '<td valign="top">...unless she''s allergic to strawberries (ha, ha). Good idea, I wonder if a different light source or lighting angle would lessen the flash hot spots?</td>', '...unless she''s allergic to strawberries (ha, ha). Good idea, I wonder if a different light source or lighting angle would lessen the flash hot spots?', '2006-02-18 10:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160894, 295873, 41675, '<td valign="top">Aww, what a sweet title. For me, the red background makes the skin tones more red and maybe a different background would have worked better. A nice portrait overall though.</td>', 'Aww, what a sweet title. For me, the red background makes the skin tones more red and maybe a different background would have worked better. A nice portrait overall though.', '2006-02-18 10:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160896, 295851, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of your image. Good lighting. The box seems to be floating, but I kind of like that.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of your image. Good lighting. The box seems to be floating, but I kind of like that.', '2006-02-18 10:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160902, 295781, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice post processing. Good, creative image that immediately gets your message across, with or without a title. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice post processing. Good, creative image that immediately gets your message across, with or without a title. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-02-18 10:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160905, 295645, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your image reminds me of a pop-art, Warhol-like illustration. That''s not necessarily a bad thing, I''m just not sure I like it personally. I think it''s the overly bright white areas on the red objects that detracts for me.</td>', 'Your image reminds me of a pop-art, Warhol-like illustration. That''s not necessarily a bad thing, I''m just not sure I like it personally. I think it''s the overly bright white areas on the red objects that detracts for me.', '2006-02-18 10:20:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2160919, 295457, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I like the textures you used, and the kaleidescope-like background.</td>', 'Nice image. I like the textures you used, and the kaleidescope-like background.', '2006-02-18 10:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160924, 295617, 41675, '<td valign="top">I really like your image, especially the color tones/values. Good composition too. Good luck in the challenge - adding it to my favorites.</td>', 'I really like your image, especially the color tones/values. Good composition too. Good luck in the challenge - adding it to my favorites.', '2006-02-18 10:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160925, 295784, 41675, '<td valign="top">I really like the patterns on the kisses - it makes this photo work. Nicely done.</td>', 'I really like the patterns on the kisses - it makes this photo work. Nicely done.', '2006-02-18 10:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160930, 295849, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the red against the black. The highlights on the leaves are a bit bright here and there, but overall a very cool shot.</td>', 'I like the red against the black. The highlights on the leaves are a bit bright here and there, but overall a very cool shot.', '2006-02-18 10:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160936, 295475, 41675, '<td valign="top">Aww, how cute. Clever idea. For me, I think a bit less black around the legs of the box would help. The back right leg of the box seems to disappear into the black - at least the way I look at it.</td>', 'Aww, how cute. Clever idea. For me, I think a bit less black around the legs of the box would help. The back right leg of the box seems to disappear into the black - at least the way I look at it.', '2006-02-18 10:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160941, 295757, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''ve been looking at your image for a few minutes now. Overall I really like it. Great composition, clarity and lighting. The one thing I keep going back to is her expression. I see the tear, but sometimes it looks like she is about to smile - maybe it''s that near Mona Lisa-like look, but that''s just me. 9</td>', 'I''ve been looking at your image for a few minutes now. Overall I really like it. Great composition, clarity and lighting. The one thing I keep going back to is her expression. I see the tear, but sometimes it looks like she is about to smile - maybe it''s that near Mona Lisa-like look, but that''s just me. 9', '2006-02-18 10:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160948, 295581, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wish there were a few more objects or something else in your image to hold my interest.</td>', 'For me, I wish there were a few more objects or something else in your image to hold my interest.', '2006-02-18 10:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160954, 295473, 41675, '<td valign="top">I find your image and post-processing very appealing. Well done and a good visual. As a repetive pattern this would make nice wrapping paper or a greeting card. Good luck in the challenge. 10</td>', 'I find your image and post-processing very appealing. Well done and a good visual. As a repetive pattern this would make nice wrapping paper or a greeting card. Good luck in the challenge. 10', '2006-02-18 10:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160955, 295808, 41675, '<td valign="top">Awww, how adorably in your face sweet! If I had my own home I would give it to this little guy. They are such sweet animals.</td>', 'Awww, how adorably in your face sweet! If I had my own home I would give it to this little guy. They are such sweet animals.', '2006-02-18 10:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160956, 295744, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is absolutely GORGEOUS!   It is so refreshing when this part of the world is seeing gray colors and barren trees.   The water droplets make this a standout flower picture.  Good luck. . . in my opinion,this is one of the best in the bunch!!</td>', 'Wow!  This is absolutely GORGEOUS!   It is so refreshing when this part of the world is seeing gray colors and barren trees.   The water droplets make this a standout flower picture.  Good luck. . . in my opinion,this is one of the best in the bunch!!', '2006-02-18 10:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160957, 295770, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the background lace, I think it works well for your setup. I wish the flowers were a bit sharper, but a nice entry.</td>', 'I like the background lace, I think it works well for your setup. I wish the flowers were a bit sharper, but a nice entry.', '2006-02-18 10:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160961, 295472, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!   I love those deep, deep greens with that vibrant red contrasting it.  This is beautiful!!   One of my favorites in this challenge!  Good Luck!  10</td>', 'Wow!   I love those deep, deep greens with that vibrant red contrasting it.  This is beautiful!!   One of my favorites in this challenge!  Good Luck!  10', '2006-02-18 10:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160963, 295721, 41675, '<td valign="top">A very nice, and very pesonal entry. I''m sorry for your loss, but what a wonderful tribute.</td>', 'A very nice, and very pesonal entry. I''m sorry for your loss, but what a wonderful tribute.', '2006-02-18 10:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160968, 295590, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like how you turned the pages in to form a heart - shows creativity. For me, I wish there was another element such as a rose or...something for additional interest.</td>', 'I like how you turned the pages in to form a heart - shows creativity. For me, I wish there was another element such as a rose or...something for additional interest.', '2006-02-18 10:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160972, 295919, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow - someone had some photoshop fun! Very interesting and intriguing. The man''s face reminds me of Matthew Brady''s civil war photographs.</td>', 'Wow - someone had some photoshop fun! Very interesting and intriguing. The man''s face reminds me of Matthew Brady''s civil war photographs.', '2006-02-18 10:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160991, 295702, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good, strong emotive image. I like the minimal use of color and the rest of your photo being black and white. Well done.</td>', 'Good, strong emotive image. I like the minimal use of color and the rest of your photo being black and white. Well done.', '2006-02-18 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160996, 295719, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cool image, I like your post-processing. Good lighting and color values.</td>', 'Cool image, I like your post-processing. Good lighting and color values.', '2006-02-18 10:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161002, 295596, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your photo is a bit on the blue side for me. I wish the swans were more white, but I like the creativity you show of shaping them into a heart.</td>', 'Your photo is a bit on the blue side for me. I wish the swans were more white, but I like the creativity you show of shaping them into a heart.', '2006-02-18 10:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161006, 295909, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice image for a greeting card. I like it. Simple, yet says alot - with or without a title. 10</td>', 'Nice image for a greeting card. I like it. Simple, yet says alot - with or without a title. 10', '2006-02-18 10:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161009, 295630, 41675, '<td valign="top">The reflections in the heart are my favorite part of your image. I also like the water foam.</td>', 'The reflections in the heart are my favorite part of your image. I also like the water foam.', '2006-02-18 10:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161019, 295628, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your photo. Good composition, lighting and tones. One question...is that truly a DPC tattoo or was it photoshopped in? 10</td>', 'I like your photo. Good composition, lighting and tones. One question...is that truly a DPC tattoo or was it photoshopped in? 10', '2006-02-18 10:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161027, 295478, 41675, '<td valign="top">Intersting image. Without your title, I wouldn''t have known what those were. It''s not a bad image, I just don''t personally find it holds my interest as well as others in the challenge.</td>', 'Intersting image. Without your title, I wouldn''t have known what those were. It''s not a bad image, I just don''t personally find it holds my interest as well as others in the challenge.', '2006-02-18 10:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161041, 295881, 41675, '<td valign="top">Great, now that song is stuck in my head ;-) (just kidding...kind of)<br/> <br/>I like your image, though the hands do seem to blend too much into the background, at least to me. Creatvie and good post processing work. I''m sure it will do well in the challenge. 9<br/> <br/>I have an inkling of the photographer, but I''ll be curious to see if I''m right when the challenge is over. Guess this means I''ve been around just long enough to possibly recognize some of the members'' works, or not.</td>', 'Great, now that song is stuck in my head ;-) (just kidding...kind of) I like your image, though the hands do seem to blend too much into the background, at least to me. Creatvie and good post processing work. I''m sure it will do well in the challenge. 9 I have an inkling of the photographer, but I''ll be curious to see if I''m right when the challenge is over. Guess this means I''ve been around just long enough to possibly recognize some of the members'' works, or not.', '2006-02-18 10:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161042, 295564, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hee hee hee. I like your image compliation. Creative, imaginative and fun. Would work well as an advertising piece. 10</td>', 'Hee hee hee. I like your image compliation. Creative, imaginative and fun. Would work well as an advertising piece. 10', '2006-02-18 10:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2161045, 295587, 41675, '<td valign="top">A good and true sentiment. I like the subtle rise/wave of the paper and the petals - nicely thought out.</td>', 'A good and true sentiment. I like the subtle rise/wave of the paper and the petals - nicely thought out.', '2006-02-18 10:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
