(2162144, 295760, 19353, '<td valign="top">Look! Look at me! My name is Depth Of Field! Actually, I don''t normally mind DOF shots. But when the technique BECOMES the subject of the shot, eclipsing the image itself, I think its fair to say I''m not a fan. Having said that, nice detail and lighting on the center heart.</td>', 'Look! Look at me! My name is Depth Of Field! Actually, I don''t normally mind DOF shots. But when the technique BECOMES the subject of the shot, eclipsing the image itself, I think its fair to say I''m not a fan. Having said that, nice detail and lighting on the center heart.', '2006-02-18 21:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162145, 295427, 19353, '<td valign="top">What are we looking at here? Chocolate and vodka? Ewwww...nasty....</td>', 'What are we looking at here? Chocolate and vodka? Ewwww...nasty....', '2006-02-18 21:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162151, 295610, 19353, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting/color choice. Fairly striking, if a little dark in the center.</td>', 'Interesting lighting/color choice. Fairly striking, if a little dark in the center.', '2006-02-18 21:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162156, 295689, 19353, '<td valign="top">Didn''t I see this object already in another shot? Have to say I like this one better. Beyond that, it doesn''t do much for me. Although I do like the shape/color of the ripples around the object.</td>', 'Didn''t I see this object already in another shot? Have to say I like this one better. Beyond that, it doesn''t do much for me. Although I do like the shape/color of the ripples around the object.', '2006-02-18 21:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162177, 295843, 19353, '<td valign="top">Hmm. A tad blurry. The head of the stethoscope appears well used, which is not necessarily a bad thing, but seems to pull away from one of the strengths of this composition, which is the contrast between cold, hard stainless steel, and the frail human skin beneath. Speaking of skin, the lighting on this shot makes the skin look fairly anemic/colorless.</td>', 'Hmm. A tad blurry. The head of the stethoscope appears well used, which is not necessarily a bad thing, but seems to pull away from one of the strengths of this composition, which is the contrast between cold, hard stainless steel, and the frail human skin beneath. Speaking of skin, the lighting on this shot makes the skin look fairly anemic/colorless.', '2006-02-18 21:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162198, 295714, 19353, '<td valign="top">The first thing that comes to mind here is...well done. The second is...OVER done. Everything is just a little TOO much. I think I would have liked this shot a lot better without the blurred decorative border. Let the objects speak for themselves. They''re nicley and dynamically arranged. As a photograph, they already have interesting things to say. The border and the screened back text scream to me..."I''m not just a photographer! I"m also a Graphic Designer!" That''s not a bad thing, necessarily, but in this case, it detracts.</td>', 'The first thing that comes to mind here is...well done. The second is...OVER done. Everything is just a little TOO much. I think I would have liked this shot a lot better without the blurred decorative border. Let the objects speak for themselves. They''re nicley and dynamically arranged. As a photograph, they already have interesting things to say. The border and the screened back text scream to me..."I''m not just a photographer! I"m also a Graphic Designer!" That''s not a bad thing, necessarily, but in this case, it detracts.', '2006-02-18 21:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162209, 295784, 19353, '<td valign="top">Probably for obvious reasons, this image seems very sensual/sexual to me. More than I would have expected. If that was your intention, well done.</td>', 'Probably for obvious reasons, this image seems very sensual/sexual to me. More than I would have expected. If that was your intention, well done.', '2006-02-18 21:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
