(2162224, 295702, 19353, '<td valign="top">This is actually a very nice shot. Something about the cropping/angle bothers me, but I can''t quite put my finger on it. Oh wait....I can almost see it.... Seriously, the angle of the model''s eyes, and the cropping of the photo draw the viewers attention away from the beutifully spot colored heart you''ve presented, and instead make this photo all about the model''s nipple, and how you can almost, but not quite, see it.</td>', 'This is actually a very nice shot. Something about the cropping/angle bothers me, but I can''t quite put my finger on it. Oh wait....I can almost see it.... Seriously, the angle of the model''s eyes, and the cropping of the photo draw the viewers attention away from the beutifully spot colored heart you''ve presented, and instead make this photo all about the model''s nipple, and how you can almost, but not quite, see it.', '2006-02-18 21:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162225, 295703, 19353, '<td valign="top">Strange, but interesting.</td>', 'Strange, but interesting.', '2006-02-18 21:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
