(2162245, 295811, 19353, '<td valign="top">yeah....at first I wasn''t that interested in this piece...or the title. It didn''t really speak to me. Until I realized that the author might be referring not to "the troops" but to the victims of US agression in the middle east. My heart does indeed go out to those whose homes have been wrecked, bodies mutilated, and families destroyed. Viewed in that context, the image of rivers of blood rolling across the globe makes this a masterpiece of irony. If it were me, I would retitle it "Good intentions Gone Bad"</td>', 'yeah....at first I wasn''t that interested in this piece...or the title. It didn''t really speak to me. Until I realized that the author might be referring not to "the troops" but to the victims of US agression in the middle east. My heart does indeed go out to those whose homes have been wrecked, bodies mutilated, and families destroyed. Viewed in that context, the image of rivers of blood rolling across the globe makes this a masterpiece of irony. If it were me, I would retitle it "Good intentions Gone Bad"', '2006-02-18 21:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162248, 295762, 19353, '<td valign="top">Huh. Is this a photograph?</td>', 'Huh. Is this a photograph?', '2006-02-18 21:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
