(2162258, 295885, 41918, '<td valign="top">Controversial!<br/>Interesting take on the challenge. I find the dark/light sections on the mirror/glass distracting, but the exposure seems bang on, as does the focus. The only thing that would help this for me would be a banknote instead of plain paper.<br/> <br/>Hope it does well for you.</td>', 'Controversial!Interesting take on the challenge. I find the dark/light sections on the mirror/glass distracting, but the exposure seems bang on, as does the focus. The only thing that would help this for me would be a banknote instead of plain paper. Hope it does well for you.', '2006-02-18 21:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162263, 295599, 41918, '<td valign="top">Bonus for the title!</td>', 'Bonus for the title!', '2006-02-18 22:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2162266, 295769, 19353, '<td valign="top">Closer than what? Closer than a parade of flags? Closer than the color blue? Closer than ever before? What a great shot. I would emphasize the monochromatic nature of this shot by cropping a half inch off the bottom, eliminating the yellow lighted portiong at bottom center. Then, the archway/windows at the end become almost a door at the end of a long tunnel. Gorgeous color on this, really. It''s just the title that throws me. It comes off as a cheap shot, trying to squeeze a photo into a challenge where it doesn''t really belong by use of a not-so-clever title.</td>', 'Closer than what? Closer than a parade of flags? Closer than the color blue? Closer than ever before? What a great shot. I would emphasize the monochromatic nature of this shot by cropping a half inch off the bottom, eliminating the yellow lighted portiong at bottom center. Then, the archway/windows at the end become almost a door at the end of a long tunnel. Gorgeous color on this, really. It''s just the title that throws me. It comes off as a cheap shot, trying to squeeze a photo into a challenge where it doesn''t really belong by use of a not-so-clever title.', '2006-02-18 22:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
