(2163086, 295873, 29009, '<td valign="top">With regard to composition, you did a nice job filling the frame.  Unfortunately, the flowers are obscuring a portion of the woman''s chin.  This image is poorly focused, although I''m sure you''ll hear that from others.<br/> <br/>Using a reflector would have helped avoid the shadow from the man''s hat brim.<br/> <br/>I think it would have been better if the people were looking at the camera, as well, but that''s just a personal preference.<br/> <br/>Lastly, there is a wrinkle in the backdrop that could have been easily cloned out given the unrestricted editing rules.<br/> <br/>The woman has a great smile on her face.<br/> <br/>Overall, this just has somewhat of a snapshot feel to it.</td>', 'With regard to composition, you did a nice job filling the frame.  Unfortunately, the flowers are obscuring a portion of the woman''s chin.  This image is poorly focused, although I''m sure you''ll hear that from others. Using a reflector would have helped avoid the shadow from the man''s hat brim. I think it would have been better if the people were looking at the camera, as well, but that''s just a personal preference. Lastly, there is a wrinkle in the backdrop that could have been easily cloned out given the unrestricted editing rules. The woman has a great smile on her face. Overall, this just has somewhat of a snapshot feel to it.', '2006-02-19 10:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
