(2168564, 295762, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice abstract feel. There are tuny imperfections as the top of the hearts cuts across the blue but overall the effect is worthy. 7</td>', 'A very nice abstract feel. There are tuny imperfections as the top of the hearts cuts across the blue but overall the effect is worthy. 7', '2006-02-21 17:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
