(2169651, 295662, 28742, '<td valign="top">Yeah right - who could get tired of you, Cindi?! :D I didn''t vote on this one, but if I had, I would''ve requested validation, but then I would remember the special rules and would have given it a 10, but then take a point off because the white thing on your head (sunglasses?)looks weird, but then I''d look at your eyes and add that point back in and then I''d have seen the title and knowing that you know I am already married, I would''ve been upset that you were taunting me, but I''d get over it and still give you that 10. Yep 10. :D</td>', 'Yeah right - who could get tired of you, Cindi?! :D I didn''t vote on this one, but if I had, I would''ve requested validation, but then I would remember the special rules and would have given it a 10, but then take a point off because the white thing on your head (sunglasses?)looks weird, but then I''d look at your eyes and add that point back in and then I''d have seen the title and knowing that you know I am already married, I would''ve been upset that you were taunting me, but I''d get over it and still give you that 10. Yep 10. :D', '2006-02-22 00:48:10.000000', NULL, 0),
