(2172375, 295719, 34217, '<td valign="top">This was the only 10 I gave out as well.  You did a wonderful job.  I can''t believe this did not ribbon.  I gave 4''s to two of the three ribbon winners.  I am not really sure what the voters were thinking, but this is quality work and there are some people on the site and know it.</td>', 'This was the only 10 I gave out as well.  You did a wonderful job.  I can''t believe this did not ribbon.  I gave 4''s to two of the three ribbon winners.  I am not really sure what the voters were thinking, but this is quality work and there are some people on the site and know it.', '2006-02-22 14:34:09.000000', NULL, 0),
