(2173142, 295662, 29490, '<td valign="top">So I''m voting and get to this photo.  I say to myself, "That''s idnic.  No, that''s some 19yo.  Well, maybe it''s her 20 years ago.  It''s not one of her daughters.  Maybe I''ve had too much cold medicine."<br/> <br/>I really like the whole gig, very heartwarming and just tugs at the whole happy thing.  And I like the added touch of the hearts in the eyes.<br/> <br/>I''m such a suck-up.</td>', 'So I''m voting and get to this photo.  I say to myself, "That''s idnic.  No, that''s some 19yo.  Well, maybe it''s her 20 years ago.  It''s not one of her daughters.  Maybe I''ve had too much cold medicine." I really like the whole gig, very heartwarming and just tugs at the whole happy thing.  And I like the added touch of the hearts in the eyes. I''m such a suck-up.', '2006-02-22 17:16:50.000000', NULL, 0),
