(2179039, 295617, 5728, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Alain_cdn:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a great picture, I''m giving it a 8. But your title.... well, to tell you exactly, this is a very bad translation. It should be "La petite fleur", but don''t worry, I did not remove any points because of that. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah my French sux I know, thanks for the correction :)<br/> <br/>I know I went out of the box on this one, but the description said "Choose your interpretation of this lovely topic" so depicting a heart wasn''t really necessary. I guess many people didn''t know the French word "coeur" means heart. And my little hearts in between the words are far too soft as well. Oh well, I''m still very happy with this image. Thanx for your votes and comments.</td>', 'Originally posted by Alain_cdn: This is a great picture, I''m giving it a 8. But your title.... well, to tell you exactly, this is a very bad translation. It should be "La petite fleur", but don''t worry, I did not remove any points because of that.   Yeah my French sux I know, thanks for the correction :) I know I went out of the box on this one, but the description said "Choose your interpretation of this lovely topic" so depicting a heart wasn''t really necessary. I guess many people didn''t know the French word "coeur" means heart. And my little hearts in between the words are far too soft as well. Oh well, I''m still very happy with this image. Thanx for your votes and comments.', '2006-02-24 10:21:19.000000', NULL, 0),
