(2190745, 295590, 332, '<td valign="top">Critique by <a href="//dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=332" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">arnit</a> <br/>I like this picture. The color of it is just perfect. It is so smooth and the shadow inside the heart is just spot on. The light that shines on the pages at the bottom of the heart is just perfect. The burning really frames the subject that is the heart. My eyes go straight to the heart and that is good. That is what a picture is suppoast to do. Lead you to the main subject. The only thing I see that could have been done better in my opinion is to find pages that had text all over it. The page on the left has fewer letter than the one on the right.<br/> <br/>Arnit<br/>Critique Club</td>', 'Critique by arnit I like this picture. The color of it is just perfect. It is so smooth and the shadow inside the heart is just spot on. The light that shines on the pages at the bottom of the heart is just perfect. The burning really frames the subject that is the heart. My eyes go straight to the heart and that is good. That is what a picture is suppoast to do. Lead you to the main subject. The only thing I see that could have been done better in my opinion is to find pages that had text all over it. The page on the left has fewer letter than the one on the right. ArnitCritique Club', '2006-02-28 21:37:07.000000', NULL, 0),
